<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TransTexas Gas a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TransTexas Gas a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer started coverage of TransTexas Gas Corp with a buy rating, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/2 to 11-7/8.</p>
</text>
